    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_f97080d1",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts armed police officers in tactical gear firing weapons, with the text overlay reading 'when cops see an armed robber.' The scene is designed to convey a sense of urgency and forceful response. The overall intent is to portray law enforcement as reacting with extreme aggression to the presence of an armed individual, potentially reinforcing harmful stereotypes about police brutality or disproportionate use of force. While not explicitly targeting a specific racial or gender group, the meme can be interpreted as contributing to a broader narrative that may normalize or sensationalize violent police responses, which can be harmful by influencing public perception of law enforcement conduct and potentially desensitizing viewers to real-world consequences of such actions. The meme does not contain direct abusive, cyberbullying, misogynistic, or propaganda elements, but its portrayal of violent escalation can be seen as harmful due to its potential to perpetuate fear, misunderstanding, or support for militarized policing.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_5d1d7e88"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
