      "instance_name": "armed_police_response",
      "label": "police officers responding to an armed threat",
      "description": "A scene depicting multiple police officers in tactical gear firing rifles in a coordinated manner, suggesting a high-stakes operational response. The officers are positioned in a line, aiming forward with visible muzzle flashes, indicating active engagement. The background is a brick wall, suggesting an urban or training environment. The scene is framed to emphasize the forceful and aggressive nature of the response, as implied by the meme text overlay.",
