      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "militarized_policing_concept",
      "label": "Concept of militarized policing",
      "description": "The image and text together imply the concept of militarized policing — the practice of law enforcement using military-style equipment, tactics, and training in civilian law enforcement contexts. This concept is not directly visible but is critical to understanding the meme’s portrayal of police as a force capable of extreme violence. It references real-world debates and controversies around the use of SWAT teams, armored vehicles, and tactical gear in routine or non-combat situations.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_5d1d7e88"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
