      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "police_brutality_stereotype",
      "label": "Stereotype of police brutality",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the stereotype that police officers frequently use excessive or lethal force, especially against armed suspects. This stereotype is rooted in real-world incidents and public discourse about police violence, which are not visible in the image but are necessary to understand the meme’s potential to reinforce harmful narratives about law enforcement conduct.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
